<td>Gearmotor (drive)</td>
<td>Supplies power and reduces motor speed to belt speed</td>
<td>Gear oil, shaft seals, motor bearings. Chain and sprockets if chain-coupled</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Bearings</td>
<td>Support the pulley and roller shafts</td>
<td>The bearing itself: seals and lubrication. Watch for noise and heat</td>
